  "description": "A purple floating ghost with claws. Low-poly character by Quaternius (CC0 1.0, public domain), from the animated model used in the KherveOS games, here in its rest pose. 1700 mm tall (1542 x 1019 x 1700 mm), standing on z = 0, centred on x/y, facing -Y. Built as one Object of 3 coloured imported meshes (STL files in meshes/ghost/ beside this part); scale the Object to resize it. 3192 triangles.",
